{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZR","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以斯拉記","commonName":"以斯拉記","title":"以斯拉記","order":15,"numberOfChapters":10,"sha256":"2edd345526963c16f60b37f65b92eca7922448a15e76df9c1bd003820a814165","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZR/1.json","lastChapterNumber":10,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZR/10.json","totalNumberOfVerses":278},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["塞魯士下令猶太人回國"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["波斯王塞魯士元年，耶和華為應驗祂藉耶利米所說的話，就感動波斯王塞魯士，使他下詔通告全國："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「波斯王塞魯士如此說，『天上的上帝耶和華已把天下萬國都賜給我，祂委派我在猶大的耶路撒冷為祂建造殿宇。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["你們當中凡屬耶和華的子民，都可以去猶大的耶路撒冷，為住在耶路撒冷的以色列的上帝耶和華建殿，願上帝與他們同在！"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["所有餘民無論寄居在哪裡，當地的人都要用金銀、財物和牲畜幫助他們，還要為耶路撒冷的上帝之殿自願獻上禮物。』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["於是，猶大和便雅憫的族長、祭司和利未人等所有被上帝感動的人，都準備上耶路撒冷重建耶和華的殿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他們周圍的人除了獻上自願獻的禮物外，還拿出銀器、金子、財物、牲畜和珍寶來支持他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["巴比倫王尼布甲尼撒曾從耶路撒冷耶和華的殿裡帶回器皿，放在自己的神廟裡。波斯王塞魯士將這些器皿取出來，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["派財政大臣米提利達如數交給猶大的首領設巴薩："]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["三十個金盤、一千個銀盤、二十九把刀、"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["三十個金碗、四百一十個次等銀碗及一千件其他器皿，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["共有五千四百件金銀器皿。被擄者從巴比倫上耶路撒冷時，設巴薩把這些器皿一併帶去。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZR/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/EZR/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/2CH/36.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}